# Rank 107 / CVE-2025-65105: Apptainer writes selinux/apparmor --security
# profiles through an ordinary procfs open, so a redirected /proc mount can make
# the label write ineffective (CWE-61, CWE-706).
#
# The spec pins code.SpecialFileAccessReview on the procfs profile load; the
# snippet expects that review observation.

test "rank107: Apptainer procfs profile load requires special-file access review"
  expect_review code.SpecialFileAccessReview
  graph
  ```
  node op code.SpecialFileAccessReview
  ```
